# Every product change lands on staging and waits for the on-device pass; main
# is production and a push there deploys (CLAUDE.md, Doctrine 7).
#
# And the hub commit is written in two files here — the marker this repo has
# reconciled with, and the pin CI checks the hub out at to run the shared
# gates. They are the same fact and they drift silently, and when they do the
# shared gates go green while running rules this repo has already adopted and
# they have never heard of. It is repo-local ON PURPOSE, because a gate
# validating the pin cannot itself be fetched at that pin. (Hub LESSONS §117.)
also=tools/hub-pin-check.mjs
work=staging
promote=main
escape=IP_PROMOTE
